================================

Purview — Git Ignore

================================

---------- Environment / Secrets ----------

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
*.secret
*.secrets

---------- Node / Next.js ----------

node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
build/
.turbo/
.vercel/

---------- Logs ----------

.log
logs/
npm-debug.log
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

---------- Python ----------

pycache/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

---------- Local databases ----------

*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

---------- OS ----------

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

---------- IDE / Editors ----------

.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json

.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

---------- Test / Coverage ----------

coverage/
.nyc_output/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

---------- Foundry ----------

cache/
out/
broadcast/
deployments/

Keep Foundry configuration/source/tests tracked.

Do NOT place private keys or deployment secrets in tracked files.

---------- Temporary files ----------

tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.backup

---------- Generated local artifacts ----------

*.local
*.local.json
*.local.yaml
*.local.yml

